WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.360
Our planet faces big problems. But for every problem, people are already building solutions.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.890
Saving Planets brings them together, in one place.

3
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:22.440
Explore 175 real solutions across 10 hubs, from oceans and forests, to lakes, rivers, and space.

4
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:30.510
Every solution is explained the same simple way: who, what, when, where, and why, with sources you can check.

5
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.220
Want to help? Ways to Help connects you with the people doing the work, so you can give, or join in.

6
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.750
Teachers can build free, printable lesson plans, from kindergarten to university.

7
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:50.400
Kids explore the Planet Map, and students build a satellite, piece by piece.

8
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.420
Myth vs Fact busts 21 doom myths with real facts,

9
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.520
and discover 26 amazing facts about our planet, and beyond.

10
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.400
Follow upcoming launches on the live tracker,

11
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:16.490
and read Saving Planets in English, French, Spanish, Arabic, and Italian.

12
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:25.240
Learn it, teach it, and help save our planet. Visit SavingPlanets.com

